        {
          "kind": "gap",
          "seconds": 0.36
        },
        {
          "kind": "line",
          "turn": 3,
          "speaker": "Aminah",
          "text": "I did. I wrote about tracing the faded trail lines and deciding the youth hiking club could use it more than my cupboard could.",
          "seconds": 7.6,
          "path": "soda_scatter/dataset/lines/soda_3209138/03_aminah.mp3",
          "vocalization": null,
          "starts_at_seconds": 14.24,
          "starts_at": "0:14.24"
        },
        {
          "kind": "gap",
          "seconds": 0.36
        },
        {
          "kind": "line",
          "turn": 4,
          "speaker": "John",
          "text": "That sounds like a good day to write about: useful, a little messy, and honest.",
          "seconds": 5.36,
          "path": "soda_scatter/dataset/lines/soda_3209138/04_john.mp3",
          "vocalization": null,
          "starts_at_seconds": 22.2,
          "starts_at": "0:22.20"
        },
        {
          "kind": "gap",
          "seconds": 0.36
        },
        {
          "kind": "line",
          "turn": 5,
          "speaker": "Aminah",
          "text": "[reflective sigh] I almost made the whole thing into a joke, but I wrote that the kitchen felt occupied again while I held the map.",
          "seconds": 9.28,
          "path": "soda_scatter/dataset/lines/soda_3209138/05_aminah.mp3",
          "vocalization": "sigh",
          "starts_at_seconds": 27.92,
          "starts_at": "0:27.92"
